    },
    {
      "id": "claim_0637fe0989514eb5bb17487ae1dc6e68",
      "statement": "The file watcher in browser mode polls lastModified timestamps every 3 seconds and reports a file as changed only after it has stopped changing (two quiet polls), preventing reads of half-written files while Excel is saving or cloud sync is in progress.",
