      "statement": "The database API exposes ~33 methods (upsertProject, getProject, applyConfigData, recordStyleExemplars, getPendingChanges, etc.) through dbBridge(), which wraps schema functions with read/write distinction: writers schedule persistence to IndexedDB, readers do not.",
