      "id": "claim_27e54ae6cefe4b7bb2a74175d1e786c7",
      "statement": "The File System Access API is Chromium-only (showDirectoryPicker unavailable in Firefox/Safari); FolderSetupScreen detects support via isFolderAccessSupported() and warns users; permission does not persist across page reloads, requiring ensurePermission() to re-grant access from a user gesture.",
