      "id": "claim_72aa1a742a5d4acf90c4894f5a7b0535",
      "statement": "Pending changes (unexported Product Spec and Recipes Spec patches) are stored in the database as crash-safe registry; getProjectSummaries() returns unexported status on every load so users are alerted to unsaved work, and changes are keyed by projectId rather than folderPath.",
