      "id": "claim_1f7300ea8b6c4026b5129f7ced2288ea",
      "statement": "The installPlatform() function checks if a real Electron API exists (via preload script) before installing the browser mock; if no preload is detected, it creates a complete window.electronAPI implementation using File System Access API and sql.js, ensuring the app runs unchanged in either environment.",
