      "statement": "The three former Flask routes (/detect-files, /import, /read-sheet) are now client-side in backend.js: detectFiles() classifies every XLSX in the folder, importFiles() parses workbooks using SheetJS (dynamically imported to avoid initial load bloat), and listXlsx() enumerates .xlsx files from a directory handle.",
