      "statement": "duplicateGroups() identifies stored directory handles that point at the same physical folder (using isSameEntry), surfacing the wreckage of the old behavior where re-picking a project forked a duplicate; each isSameEntry comparison is guarded so one stale handle never blinds the whole scan.",
